{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act21side_level_act21side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act21side",
  "stageId": "act21side_07",
  "title": "何以忘却",
  "storyCode": "IS-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b9bd00b6e9168e702258a31a6daac7daca329027efff0637cd5891f39aa2201b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "最不起眼的食品安全部......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "有人缘但不被重视的食品安全部部长......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "事到如今，卡拉奇这样，为了各大家族之间的平衡而被推选出来的人已经不再需要了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "您需要一个安全而又好用的傀儡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "卢比奥部长，真正安全而又好用的傀儡，从来不会这么自称。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "我只是比其他人多一些自知之明而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "哈哈哈，好一个自知之明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "卢比奥，如你所说，你确实是替代卡拉奇的最好人选。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "不过，既然你如此坦诚，那我也不妨告诉你一些事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "您请说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "卡拉奇，是我的人杀的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "你很有勇气，我不讨厌和你这样的人聊天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "所以，我可以给你一个机会，卢比奥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "走出这间房间，忘记你刚才说过的话，这样的话，你不会受到任何伤害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "然后，回去和你的妻子还有女儿团聚，好好享受这座城市最后的一点安宁时光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "如果是这样，您难道不是更加需要一个我这样的傀儡吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "您想要的，正是眼下的混乱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "您想要推翻西西里夫人定下的秩序，然而，西西里夫人治下也好，更早的时期也好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "家族之间的斗争，从来与普通人无关。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "当一切发生时，我们只能等待一个结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "从这个角度来说，是西西里夫人统领这个国家，还是您统领这个国家，对我们普通人来说毫无分别。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "但是，最后的胜利者，却总是需要一个统领表面秩序的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "您作为一个家族的领袖，想必是明白这个道理的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "普通人离开家族并非无法生存，但家族离开普通人，却未必如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "你想说，你们才是强者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "不过是一些弱者的自圆其说罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "好一个自圆其说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "但这不能解释你真正的目的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "权力，尊敬的贝纳尔多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "我从小就因为这副长相和孱弱的体格，被身边的人看不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "对我来说，来自身边的人的压迫，比来自家族的还要直接。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "我一路隐忍到现在，就是为了等这一个机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "所以您说是您杀了卡拉奇，我只觉得，我这一次来对了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "说句您不爱听的，您想对抗西西里夫人，我觉得，您很难获胜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "但这又有什么关系呢，我不在乎您到最后能不能赢——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "但这份权力，西西里夫人给不了我，只有您能给我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "你很诚实，卢比奥，我喜欢和诚实的人交朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "首领......（耳语）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "传下命令，就说，今天到此为止。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "刚才怎么了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "那边的房间......好像震了一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "看来，她选择了你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "这股震动，是乔万娜的源石技艺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "她们决裂了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "看，德克萨斯从窗户跳出去了，我们快跟上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "唉，德克萨斯，如果，我是说如果，当年我们成了朋友，是不是，我就能把你留在叙拉古呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "哈，不可能吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "我们只会互相厮杀至死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洗车工",
      "text": "拉维妮娅小姐，不要逼我......杀了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洗车工",
      "text": "我有我的任务要完成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洗车工",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洗车工",
      "text": "拉维妮娅小姐，下辈子，希望你不要出生在叙拉古。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洗车工",
      "text": "......你是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "你是......萨卢佐家族的杀手吧？这场行动......已经结束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "贝纳尔多先生在刚才已经下令了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "拉维妮娅，你不该出现在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "和你无关。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "你妨碍了萨卢佐家族的行动，这会破坏我们两个家族之间的关系。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "......哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "那么，不妨用我的头颅去向阿尔贝托请罪，如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "等一等，贝纳尔多先生......不，阁下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "我有一个不情之请。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "想必莱昂图索少爷接下来也会十分繁忙，要他像之前协助卡拉奇那样协助我，恐怕是不现实的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "我正想要向您要一个新的助手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "法官小姐显然是一个十分合适的选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "倒也确实是个办法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "......你们在说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "啊，瞧我，拉维妮娅小姐，把您晾在一边擅自就把话题进行下去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "就在刚才，贝纳尔多阁下决定，由鄙人，前食品安全部部长卢比奥，接替卡拉奇的位置，成为下一任的建设部部长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "而我必须诚实地说，我在政府相关事务方面并没有足够的经验。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "所以，我希望富有经验的您，来成为我的助手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "（不知道空她们的状况如何......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......为什么，你......您会在这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "人老了，总是想找个地方享享清福。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "找到了！她在那！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "包围她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "看来，您是不打算让路了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "因为当年的事，她还是颇为担心你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我呢，年纪大了，如今爱做的，也不过是关照一下年轻人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "留下陪我这个老头子聊聊天吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......下次一定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "可颂？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "嘿，让我瞧瞧，是谁在这里孤军奋战啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......怎么你们都来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "根据我的观察，叙拉古家族的企业文化应该是——打群架。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "而我们企鹅物流的企业文化则是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "派对？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "这个场合，应该是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "从不怕群架，对吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "完全正确！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "说真的，老爷爷，看在我们是同族的分上，不能放我们一马吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "别说蠢话了，能天使。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "有一定的道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "唉，叙拉古的雨季也确实漫长了些，年轻的时候没有感觉，如今，关节炎也是个烦恼啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "年轻人们，争强好胜不是坏事，但也要注意身体健康。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "欸，不是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "谢啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "对了，如果我想和您聊天的话，该去哪里找您呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "若你寻找救赎，那我无计可施。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "若你寻找秩序，那我无处不在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......好了，让我们离开这里吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "噢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "首领。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "状况如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "贝洛内的人撤退了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "做得好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "切利尼娜呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "她走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "她杀不了我，我也杀不了她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "该回去准备一下了，贝洛内不会善罢甘休的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "......我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "你赢了，莱昂图索。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "笼络瓦拉赫，并不是首领的打算，对吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "但是，在那个场合下，这才是最好的选择，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "......我不否认，咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "好了，别说话了，我扶你去车上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "莱昂，你还是没有放弃，对吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "这点挫折，和拉维妮娅遇到的困难相比，又算什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "......你是做大事的人，莱昂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "有一天，或许你真的能在叙拉古实现你的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "到时候，你要来做我的帮手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "我跟拉维妮娅可合不来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "有些事情适合她来做，但有些事情，适合你来做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "哈哈，你小子，已经在盘算这样的事情了吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "......德米特，我依然愤怒于你和父亲的谋划。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "我还是不明白为什么父亲坚持要在现在动手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "但是，我终究是这个家族的一分子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "安全着陆！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "呼......呼......还是自己的据点舒服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "呼，叙拉古的人还真是缠人，累死我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "空，你还好吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "嗯，就是礼服稍微破了一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "欸，这件衣服我记得蛮贵的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "啊哈哈，总会有办法的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "来，一人一瓶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "好啦，别摆出那副表情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "你就当做我们三个只是凑巧也在这座城市旅行而已吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......但是，演员是怎么回事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "啊......那个的话，只是顺便拓展一下业务而已啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "而且，我想这样说不定能比较方便找到你嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "从结果上来说，确实也达成了目的就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "确实。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空气稍微凝滞了一会儿。\n一个无法回避的问题在此时浮现。\n接下来怎么办？\n德克萨斯无法问出口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "德......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "德克萨斯，我和总监有过约定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "即使我找到了你，我也会继续在这里完成我的演员合约。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "但——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "我和总监有过一些交流，虽然现在回想起来有些后怕，但我相信，他不是那种会以我们的安危来威胁你的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "确实欸，如果那个伯伯想这么做的话，我们早就被抓起来了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "呜哇，你别说了，越说我越觉得吓人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "我们是来找你顺便观光的，如果不是现在情况很危险，我还想让你带我们到处走走呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......好，等事情结束后，一定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "总而言之，先让我们庆祝，企鹅物流在叙拉古再聚首！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "四人一同",
      "text": "干杯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "重要的是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "没有见过的号码。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "我应该没有告诉过其他人，这里的号码......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "你好，请问......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "空小姐，看来你平安无事，这样我就放心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "您知道德克萨斯的事了，对吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "放宽心，空小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "想必企鹅物流的几位正沉浸在重逢的喜悦之中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "所以我也不打算过多打扰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "只是，我想你应当也有许多事情想要问我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "所以，明天，我会在剧院等你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "......我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
